@startuml
title Local Music 与 Voice Assistant 流程

skinparam shadowing false

actor 用户 as User
participant "Local Music Page" as MusicPage
participant "Voice Assistant" as VoiceUI
participant "window.api.music" as MusicApi
participant "window.api.voice" as VoiceApi
participant "Music Service" as MusicService
participant "Voice Service" as VoiceService
participant "Agent Runtime / Command Router" as Agent
participant "Permission Gate" as Gate
database "App SQLite" as DB
folder "Music Library" as Files

User -> MusicPage: 添加音乐目录
MusicPage -> MusicApi: addLibrary(path)
MusicApi -> MusicService: 记录目录
MusicService -> Files: 扫描音频文件
MusicService -> DB: 写入曲目元数据

User -> MusicPage: 播放曲目
MusicPage -> MusicApi: play(trackId)
MusicApi -> MusicService: 播放
MusicService -> DB: 更新最近播放

User -> VoiceUI: 语音命令
VoiceUI -> VoiceApi: startDictation()
VoiceApi -> VoiceService: ASR
VoiceService -> Agent: 文本命令
Agent -> Gate: 校验命令权限

alt 控制音乐
  Gate --> Agent: 允许
  Agent -> MusicService: 播放 / 暂停 / 搜索
  MusicService --> Agent: 状态
  Agent -> VoiceService: TTS 可选播报
else 高风险命令
  Gate --> Agent: 拒绝或要求确认
  Agent -> VoiceUI: 展示确认或拒绝
end

@enduml
